  "body": "Occupying an exclusive position on one of Torbay’s most sought-after streets, 10 Cliff Road is a distinguished European-inspired residence, where grand proportions, timeless character and spectacular Hauraki Gulf vistas combine to create an exceptional coastal offering.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned on 1,265sqm of prime coastal land, this substantial 335sqm residence was crafted in solid concrete during the 1970s and has since undergone some significant improvements. Its elevated cliffside setting captures magnificent sea views across the Hauraki Gulf and outer islands, with the outlook extending from almost every room. Surrounded by established gardens and mature greenery, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity, while Torbay village and its beautiful beaches remain just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nA striking introduction sets the tone, with a grand entrance hall, sweeping staircase and magnificent Italian chandelier establishing an unmistakable European character. Generously proportioned living spaces are complemented by rich timber flooring and an inviting open fireplace, while a brand-new kitchen provides a stylish contemporary centrepiece, thoughtfully positioned to enjoy framed ocean views. Living and entertaining areas flow effortlessly to the outdoors, creating an inviting connection between the home and its spectacular surroundings.\r\n\r\nOffering four to five bedrooms, the versatile accommodation includes the flexibility of a dedicated pool-utility room and separate office, alongside four bathrooms. Generous in scale and thoughtfully configured, the home provides an exceptional environment for family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nBeyond the interiors, established gardens and expansive lawns create a beautifully private sanctuary. A resort style swimming pool provides the perfect setting for relaxed summer afternoons, while a double garage and additional off-street parking, including space for a boat, complete the practicality of this unique family home.",
